---
from "@/components/Board.nexy" import Board
from src.board import now, render_number

# The whole of ISR: this page is rendered once, then served from memory for 30 seconds. After
# that, a visit still gets the stored copy at once while a new one is rendered behind it.
revalidate = 30

metadata = {"title": "Cached board", "description": "A page rendered once, then served from memory for 30 seconds."}
number = render_number()
rendered_at = now()
---
<h1 class="text-3xl font-semibold">Departures</h1>
<p class="mt-3 text-foreground-second">This page has <code>revalidate = 30</code>. Reload it: the time below stays the same for 30 seconds, because the server sends the copy it stored instead of rendering the page again.</p>
<p class="mt-6 rounded-lg bg-background-second px-4 py-3 text-sm">Render <strong data-render>{{ number }}</strong>, at <time>{{ rendered_at }}</time>.</p>
<Board />
